47
00:02:29,916 --> 00:02:32,868
<i>When I was a boy,
I had a dog named Freddy.</i>

48
00:02:32,936 --> 00:02:35,837
<i>He was my best friend.</i>

49
00:02:35,906 --> 00:02:37,873
